
Preset: Verified Codebase Context

  ID:          codebase-memory-context
  Version:     1.1.0
  Description: Generate evidence-qualified repository context and use it across 
planning, tasks, analysis, and implementation
  Author:      Xu Yin (philo-x)
  Tags:        code-intelligence, codebase-memory, architecture, workflow
  Templates:   6
    - speckit.codebase-memory (command): Generate or refresh evidence-qualified 
repository context
    - speckit.plan (command): Use repository context while planning a feature
    - speckit.tasks (command): Use repository context while generating tasks
    - speckit.analyze (command): Check design artifacts against repository 
context before implementation
    - speckit.implement (command): Use repository context while implementing 
tasks
    - codebase-context-template (template): Stable output structure for 
evidence-qualified repository context
  Repository:  
https://github.com/philo-x/spec-kit-preset-codebase-memory-context
  License:     MIT

  Status: installed
  Priority: 10

